CORE buechi
sva_assume2.sv
--buechi --bdd
^\[main\.assume\.1\] always \(main\.a implies \(nexttime main\.a\)\): UNSUPPORTED: assumption not supported by BDD engine$
^\[main\.assert\.2\] always \(main\.a \|=> \$stable\(main\.a\)\): INCONCLUSIVE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The BDD engine cannot add an assumption with a temporal operator to the
transition relation.  The property holds under the assumption, and thus
must not be reported as REFUTED.
